(5145308, 749084, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a really disturbing image - catches you unawares. Makes me want to ask if everyone is OK....<br/> <br/>I hope this is just a general reminder to us that Christmas isn''t a great time for everybody - a message worth remembering.</td>', 'This is a really disturbing image - catches you unawares. Makes me want to ask if everyone is OK.... I hope this is just a general reminder to us that Christmas isn''t a great time for everybody - a message worth remembering.', '2008-12-22 00:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
