(5145324, 749084, 83080, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Now that''s saying something.  Being a person without belief in an afterlife I might have titled it <i>Nothingness Eternal</i> but this title is probably more powerful for the typical viewer.  The shallow DOF through the face does a nice job in my mind of contrasting this moment''s focus/intent with its confusion/chaos.  It creates a very visual sense of cognitive dissonance.<br/> <br/>Well, I can''t wait to see the comments you get from this.  BTW: Here is a <a href="//www.psychologytoday.com/articles/pto-20040105-000026.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">side note regarding the suicide and holidays myth</a>.  To me it''s not the number of suicides that matters at this time of year anyhow.  I''m more troubled by how blithely people toss off reality in general to the point where anything unpleasant becomes taboo during the holidays.  <br/> <br/>Hats off to you for putting up something that will certainly make some people think.</td>', 'Hey!  Now that''s saying something.  Being a person without belief in an afterlife I might have titled it Nothingness Eternal but this title is probably more powerful for the typical viewer.  The shallow DOF through the face does a nice job in my mind of contrasting this moment''s focus/intent with its confusion/chaos.  It creates a very visual sense of cognitive dissonance. Well, I can''t wait to see the comments you get from this.  BTW: Here is a side note regarding the suicide and holidays myth.  To me it''s not the number of suicides that matters at this time of year anyhow.  I''m more troubled by how blithely people toss off reality in general to the point where anything unpleasant becomes taboo during the holidays.   Hats off to you for putting up something that will certainly make some people think.', '2008-12-22 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145327, 749122, 96915, '<td valign="top">this looks magical!</td>', 'this looks magical!', '2008-12-22 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145332, 748525, 96915, '<td valign="top">I understand that this was probably intended to be dark, but to me it''s a bit too dark with not quite enough contrast to work for m.</td>', 'I understand that this was probably intended to be dark, but to me it''s a bit too dark with not quite enough contrast to work for m.', '2008-12-22 01:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
