(5145508, 749013, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the choice of colour and subject brings a nice mood and feel.<br/>Ordinarily I''d find the background distracting as it''s neither in focus or totally out of focus, but in this case I think the main subject holds the attention.</td>', 'Nice shot, the choice of colour and subject brings a nice mood and feel.Ordinarily I''d find the background distracting as it''s neither in focus or totally out of focus, but in this case I think the main subject holds the attention.', '2008-12-22 04:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
