(5145514, 748839, 55956, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this will be a ribbon for you but securely this image will go very near to the ribbons. great scene, great sharpness, great bokeh on the background that exalt the subjects. the only thing that play against this photo could be that someone could consider it an outtake of the bokeh challenge. now I begin voting but seeing the thubnail this image outstanding from the others, this is a good thing for you. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know if this will be a ribbon for you but securely this image will go very near to the ribbons. great scene, great sharpness, great bokeh on the background that exalt the subjects. the only thing that play against this photo could be that someone could consider it an outtake of the bokeh challenge. now I begin voting but seeing the thubnail this image outstanding from the others, this is a good thing for you. good luck in the challenge.', '2008-12-22 04:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
