(5146273, 748066, 67152, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and you photographered her very well. The white background is perfect for this type of image.  <br/> <br/>The ribbon draped around her really works well - but the bow does not work for me at all - it what my eye is first drawn to.  This is a shame as I think it gives the image a more overt sexual feeling than the sensual feeling the rest of the image gives.  I wonder if a slightly different wrapping of the ribbon so that you could cover her with that instead of the bow could have worked a bit better.</td>', 'A beautiful model and you photographered her very well. The white background is perfect for this type of image.   The ribbon draped around her really works well - but the bow does not work for me at all - it what my eye is first drawn to.  This is a shame as I think it gives the image a more overt sexual feeling than the sensual feeling the rest of the image gives.  I wonder if a slightly different wrapping of the ribbon so that you could cover her with that instead of the bow could have worked a bit better.', '2008-12-22 13:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
