(5146550, 748674, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the blur! Looks very nice with the border and the black and white, too. The person at the end of the road adds the perfect touch - the shot wouldn''t be as good without him, imho. :)</td>', 'I love the blur! Looks very nice with the border and the black and white, too. The person at the end of the road adds the perfect touch - the shot wouldn''t be as good without him, imho. :)', '2008-12-22 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146553, 749129, 63269, '<td valign="top">Hehe! What a classic move. This does look a bit grainy on my screen, and for some reason the gun almost looks green, but you''ve set your shot up very nicely. The only thing I might have changed would be to move the "Merry Christmas" words at the bottom if possible, they''re a little distracting. But otherwise this is very well done!</td>', 'Hehe! What a classic move. This does look a bit grainy on my screen, and for some reason the gun almost looks green, but you''ve set your shot up very nicely. The only thing I might have changed would be to move the "Merry Christmas" words at the bottom if possible, they''re a little distracting. But otherwise this is very well done!', '2008-12-22 16:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146557, 748437, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like this a <u>lot.</u> I just wish it were a little clearer as to what this whole scene is... my best guess is a streetlight over a snow-covered car. But the composition and the concept are terrific, and create a delightfully interesting image!</td>', 'I like this a lot. I just wish it were a little clearer as to what this whole scene is... my best guess is a streetlight over a snow-covered car. But the composition and the concept are terrific, and create a delightfully interesting image!', '2008-12-22 16:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146559, 749157, 63269, '<td valign="top">Alright, you''ve probably gotten several comments on it, but I personally think the border is really more distracting than anything else. The colors are terrific though!</td>', 'Alright, you''ve probably gotten several comments on it, but I personally think the border is really more distracting than anything else. The colors are terrific though!', '2008-12-22 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146560, 748045, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting (high-key?) and the colors! Great work.</td>', 'I really like the lighting (high-key?) and the colors! Great work.', '2008-12-22 16:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146563, 748994, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents... :) On my screen, this appears a little grainy. Also, I think this could use just a bit more contrast - it looks a little washed out and flat. The boxes are very nicely arranged, and pleasing to the eye, but there isn''t much of a composition here. My eyes wander over the photograph. I have no idea what to suggest to fix that though. My only thought would be to try experimenting with some shallow depth of field. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents... :) On my screen, this appears a little grainy. Also, I think this could use just a bit more contrast - it looks a little washed out and flat. The boxes are very nicely arranged, and pleasing to the eye, but there isn''t much of a composition here. My eyes wander over the photograph. I have no idea what to suggest to fix that though. My only thought would be to try experimenting with some shallow depth of field. Just a thought. :)', '2008-12-22 16:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146565, 749130, 63269, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like it when things are over-sharpened like this, but here it works <i>beautifully</i>, creating glowing tones and soft gentle colors! Only, I wonder how this might have looked if it were more symetrical? Just a thought.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like it when things are over-sharpened like this, but here it works beautifully, creating glowing tones and soft gentle colors! Only, I wonder how this might have looked if it were more symetrical? Just a thought.', '2008-12-22 16:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146567, 748898, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is good here, except I wonder if there was any way to somehow separate the boy a little more from the clutter of the house behind him, so that he was more distinct... The colors and strong contrasts work wonderfully here, though.</td>', 'The composition is good here, except I wonder if there was any way to somehow separate the boy a little more from the clutter of the house behind him, so that he was more distinct... The colors and strong contrasts work wonderfully here, though.', '2008-12-22 16:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146570, 748932, 63269, '<td valign="top">The black and white works great here, and the composition is fascinating!</td>', 'The black and white works great here, and the composition is fascinating!', '2008-12-22 16:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146572, 748959, 63269, '<td valign="top">The  colors, light, and focus are all great here, but the composition is cluttered and doesn''t work very well, imho. My eyes aren''t sure where to rest. I admit though, paper money is a difficult subject to shoot...</td>', 'The  colors, light, and focus are all great here, but the composition is cluttered and doesn''t work very well, imho. My eyes aren''t sure where to rest. I admit though, paper money is a difficult subject to shoot...', '2008-12-22 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146573, 749151, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Lovely lighting.', '2008-12-22 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146577, 749084, 63269, '<td valign="top">Needless to say, extremely powerful subject content. The lighting and depth of field make this perfect.</td>', 'Needless to say, extremely powerful subject content. The lighting and depth of field make this perfect.', '2008-12-22 16:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146578, 747980, 63269, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the most interesting of photography subjects, but certainly great composition and lighting!</td>', 'Maybe not the most interesting of photography subjects, but certainly great composition and lighting!', '2008-12-22 16:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
