(5146593, 748764, 63269, '<td valign="top">this looks just slighly over-exposed. Also the shadow on the top of the photo really throws the photo off balance, imho, and makes the lighting look harsh. The colors and the shallow dof are <i>perfect</i>, though. :)</td>', 'this looks just slighly over-exposed. Also the shadow on the top of the photo really throws the photo off balance, imho, and makes the lighting look harsh. The colors and the shallow dof are perfect, though. :)', '2008-12-22 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146594, 748937, 63269, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is perfect.</td>', 'The simplicity is perfect.', '2008-12-22 16:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146599, 748611, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks very grainy on my screen, which really detracts from this image a lot. The background doesn''t add much to the photo either, and I personally and not fond of the centered composition.... but - I do really love the desaturation, and the shallow depth of field looks great. :)</td>', 'This looks very grainy on my screen, which really detracts from this image a lot. The background doesn''t add much to the photo either, and I personally and not fond of the centered composition.... but - I do really love the desaturation, and the shallow depth of field looks great. :)', '2008-12-22 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146600, 749081, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, the detail you''ve captured on this looks really yummy, but on my screen there is a yellow-green color cast to the whole image, which does not make it look appealing.  Perhaps a white balance problem? Otherwise this is pretty good.</td>', 'Well, the detail you''ve captured on this looks really yummy, but on my screen there is a yellow-green color cast to the whole image, which does not make it look appealing.  Perhaps a white balance problem? Otherwise this is pretty good.', '2008-12-22 16:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146601, 749147, 63269, '<td valign="top">Personally I might not have cropped off the top of the boy''s head, but this is perfect in black and white. Nicely exposed and with just the right amount of texture and contrast. Bravo.</td>', 'Personally I might not have cropped off the top of the boy''s head, but this is perfect in black and white. Nicely exposed and with just the right amount of texture and contrast. Bravo.', '2008-12-22 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146603, 748934, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is wonderful, the textures delightful, and the colors perfect. Very nicely done! :)</td>', 'The composition is wonderful, the textures delightful, and the colors perfect. Very nicely done! :)', '2008-12-22 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146604, 749113, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit underexposed, but otherwise, the colors are great.</td>', 'This looks a bit underexposed, but otherwise, the colors are great.', '2008-12-22 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146605, 749121, 63269, '<td valign="top">On my screen this is looking a bit more like a "gray" christmas... perhaps it was underexposed? Also, for some reason, the composition feels a little claustrophobic to me, but I don''t know how that could be fixed. Maybe a less tight crop? Otherwise not bad - I like how clean it all looks.</td>', 'On my screen this is looking a bit more like a "gray" christmas... perhaps it was underexposed? Also, for some reason, the composition feels a little claustrophobic to me, but I don''t know how that could be fixed. Maybe a less tight crop? Otherwise not bad - I like how clean it all looks.', '2008-12-22 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146606, 749083, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the bright, clean lighting and the cheery colors! Very nice work.</td>', 'I love the bright, clean lighting and the cheery colors! Very nice work.', '2008-12-22 17:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146607, 748921, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors here. Beautiful work!</td>', 'I really love the colors here. Beautiful work!', '2008-12-22 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146608, 749067, 63269, '<td valign="top">Terrific focus and lighting. Looks maybe just a tad underexposed though?</td>', 'Terrific focus and lighting. Looks maybe just a tad underexposed though?', '2008-12-22 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146613, 748525, 63269, '<td valign="top">First of all, I''m finding the tilted horizon distraction. Also,  this looks a tad underexposed... perhaps you intended that though, because it does give the image a very gloomy mood. I do wonder though, how this might look if at least something were bright. Perhaps the people passing by should be bright, and the boy in the dark, underexposed shadows, to emphasize the concept that he is alone while everyone else is enjoying the hustle and bustle of the holidays. That could probably be achieved with burning and dodging in photoshop. Just some thoughts - sorry for rambling. :) The composition is great here, and the black and white perfect. Overall this is a very nicely done photograph.</td>', 'First of all, I''m finding the tilted horizon distraction. Also,  this looks a tad underexposed... perhaps you intended that though, because it does give the image a very gloomy mood. I do wonder though, how this might look if at least something were bright. Perhaps the people passing by should be bright, and the boy in the dark, underexposed shadows, to emphasize the concept that he is alone while everyone else is enjoying the hustle and bustle of the holidays. That could probably be achieved with burning and dodging in photoshop. Just some thoughts - sorry for rambling. :) The composition is great here, and the black and white perfect. Overall this is a very nicely done photograph.', '2008-12-22 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146616, 748961, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure I like the yellow-greeny colors, but I realize from personal experience that christmas tree colors can be difficult to perfect... I was going practically insane the other day trying to white-balance! :D You achieved a much nicer shot than the ones I ended up with, especially since the lighting and focus  are so superb. Great work! :)</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure I like the yellow-greeny colors, but I realize from personal experience that christmas tree colors can be difficult to perfect... I was going practically insane the other day trying to white-balance! :D You achieved a much nicer shot than the ones I ended up with, especially since the lighting and focus  are so superb. Great work! :)', '2008-12-22 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5146619, 749138, 63269, '<td valign="top">Looks a little grainy on my screen, but I love the focus, the composition - everything! Very nice work!</td>', 'Looks a little grainy on my screen, but I love the focus, the composition - everything! Very nice work!', '2008-12-22 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
