(5147773, 748066, 65858, '<td valign="top">I have so many one-liners for this, I can''t choose, so I''ll just hit you with them all:<br/> <br/>- To quote Mr Potato Head from Toy Story II, "I''m a married spud, I''m a married spud".<br/>- Somebody get the freaking mistletoe!<br/>- Part of me says 10, and part of me says 7... I compromised and voted 10.<br/> <br/>Seriously, though, it''s a great shot - nice lighting and color balance, and humorously meets the challenge.  I wish you luck!</td>', 'I have so many one-liners for this, I can''t choose, so I''ll just hit you with them all: - To quote Mr Potato Head from Toy Story II, "I''m a married spud, I''m a married spud".- Somebody get the freaking mistletoe!- Part of me says 10, and part of me says 7... I compromised and voted 10. Seriously, though, it''s a great shot - nice lighting and color balance, and humorously meets the challenge.  I wish you luck!', '2008-12-23 14:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147777, 748120, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the idea behind this for the challenge topic.  The shot is also a bit too grainy, contrasty, and abstract for my taste. Though the object on the left has interesting lighting and textures, the overblown umbrella bokeh is too different in style to make this a cohesive image for me.</td>', 'I''m not getting the idea behind this for the challenge topic.  The shot is also a bit too grainy, contrasty, and abstract for my taste. Though the object on the left has interesting lighting and textures, the overblown umbrella bokeh is too different in style to make this a cohesive image for me.', '2008-12-23 14:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147780, 748903, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes and shadows.  I think the tilt is too much though, and detracts from the power of the shot.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes and shadows.  I think the tilt is too much though, and detracts from the power of the shot.', '2008-12-23 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147784, 748525, 65858, '<td valign="top">Touchingly sad.  The dark exposure sets the mood, the tilted horizon suggests that all is not right in the world, while the passers-by go about their business.  Definitely a 10.</td>', 'Touchingly sad.  The dark exposure sets the mood, the tilted horizon suggests that all is not right in the world, while the passers-by go about their business.  Definitely a 10.', '2008-12-23 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147787, 749138, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is going to be on the front page, if not ribbon.  Wondrous subject, excellent textures (tootsies, binky, quilty).  Awesome in BW.  If I were to be picky at all, I''d say that the light is just a teensie bit too even.  Since this is advanced editing, I might have separated the feet from the blanket a bit more.</td>', 'This is going to be on the front page, if not ribbon.  Wondrous subject, excellent textures (tootsies, binky, quilty).  Awesome in BW.  If I were to be picky at all, I''d say that the light is just a teensie bit too even.  Since this is advanced editing, I might have separated the feet from the blanket a bit more.', '2008-12-23 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
