(5147849, 748525, 27556, '<td valign="top">aww lonely kid, great idea for a shot, the tilted horizon is not working for me though, either keep it straight and level or go extreeme and really tilt it. Also the exposure is right for the buildings in the background not the ally or the kid, be careful what you want to center of attention to be</td>', 'aww lonely kid, great idea for a shot, the tilted horizon is not working for me though, either keep it straight and level or go extreeme and really tilt it. Also the exposure is right for the buildings in the background not the ally or the kid, be careful what you want to center of attention to be', '2008-12-23 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147852, 748932, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail on the ring top and the circle on the ring edge.  I''m not sure about what it''s sitting on or the border.  Too many conflicting geometric shapes and angles, distracting from the subject.  But very crisp and professional bw.</td>', 'Awesome detail on the ring top and the circle on the ring edge.  I''m not sure about what it''s sitting on or the border.  Too many conflicting geometric shapes and angles, distracting from the subject.  But very crisp and professional bw.', '2008-12-23 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147854, 748764, 27556, '<td valign="top">not sure why this would be wanted for chrismass but what ever floats your boat ;-) as for the technicals I feel the lighting is harsh, and it its over exposed, that piece of metal seems to be the center of attention (where my eye is drawn) not the peas,</td>', 'not sure why this would be wanted for chrismass but what ever floats your boat ;-) as for the technicals I feel the lighting is harsh, and it its over exposed, that piece of metal seems to be the center of attention (where my eye is drawn) not the peas,', '2008-12-23 14:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147856, 748916, 27556, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful animal, great choice for the b&amp;w, and the border</td>', 'what a beautiful animal, great choice for the b&w, and the border', '2008-12-23 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147860, 749090, 27556, '<td valign="top">not a big fan of toy / doll / stuffed animal shots (but I have done some my self I know it can be tempting)Im not sure if its the lighting or if its the exposure but there are several hot spots (on the orniment, the horn etc)</td>', 'not a big fan of toy / doll / stuffed animal shots (but I have done some my self I know it can be tempting)Im not sure if its the lighting or if its the exposure but there are several hot spots (on the orniment, the horn etc)', '2008-12-23 15:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147862, 748674, 27556, '<td valign="top">I find this shot very interesting, the blur is disorientating at first but sucks you right into it great job.</td>', 'I find this shot very interesting, the blur is disorientating at first but sucks you right into it great job.', '2008-12-23 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147870, 748101, 27556, '<td valign="top">Im not sure what it is that is wanted for christmas, a kid to come home? did a child pass away, im really not getting the meaning here. On a technical note. It seems like the only think in focus (kind of) is Eeyore, the lighting is very very flat,  and I dont know what purpose the blue squiggles on the wall are serving.</td>', 'Im not sure what it is that is wanted for christmas, a kid to come home? did a child pass away, im really not getting the meaning here. On a technical note. It seems like the only think in focus (kind of) is Eeyore, the lighting is very very flat,  and I dont know what purpose the blue squiggles on the wall are serving.', '2008-12-23 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147871, 749147, 27556, '<td valign="top">great capture, the exposure on the pup''s face needs a bit of work, its hard to see his left half''s details, but over all nice job</td>', 'great capture, the exposure on the pup''s face needs a bit of work, its hard to see his left half''s details, but over all nice job', '2008-12-23 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147876, 749146, 27556, '<td valign="top">I didnt enter the challenge this week, but I had the same idea as you for this shot, so bonus point for thinking like me =) this is beautiful, I wouldnt have been able to pull it off this well great job</td>', 'I didnt enter the challenge this week, but I had the same idea as you for this shot, so bonus point for thinking like me =) this is beautiful, I wouldnt have been able to pull it off this well great job', '2008-12-23 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147878, 748954, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Love the gradient background, the colors, the detail on the face, the concept.  Because this is so good, I''ll be picky and say it looks like the petals may have been a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Love the gradient background, the colors, the detail on the face, the concept.  Because this is so good, I''ll be picky and say it looks like the petals may have been a bit over sharpened.', '2008-12-23 15:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147879, 748525, 96751, '<td valign="top">Waaaaaaaaaaaay too dark all around.  On my monitor I almost completely missed the child in the left foreground.</td>', 'Waaaaaaaaaaaay too dark all around.  On my monitor I almost completely missed the child in the left foreground.', '2008-12-23 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147880, 749070, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting feel to this shot.  Very vintagy, with a modern subject.</td>', 'Interesting feel to this shot.  Very vintagy, with a modern subject.', '2008-12-23 15:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147882, 748645, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but overall, the image feels a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Nice concept but overall, the image feels a bit flat to me.', '2008-12-23 15:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147883, 749120, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT product shot.  Perfect use of dof and lighting, the tilt adds some interest, no question where the focal point is.</td>', 'GREAT product shot.  Perfect use of dof and lighting, the tilt adds some interest, no question where the focal point is.', '2008-12-23 15:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147923, 749026, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous and dynamic shot.  Great light and background.  But I think the hand is a bit distracting - too vague to be readily identified, to definite to be ignored.  I feel it draws too much attention from the main subject.</td>', 'Fabulous and dynamic shot.  Great light and background.  But I think the hand is a bit distracting - too vague to be readily identified, to definite to be ignored.  I feel it draws too much attention from the main subject.', '2008-12-23 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147924, 749153, 96751, '<td valign="top">Way too much sharpening here.</td>', 'Way too much sharpening here.', '2008-12-23 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147926, 748921, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, although I think better lighting on the face would have made him the subject and not just part of a very busy collage.</td>', 'Fun shot, although I think better lighting on the face would have made him the subject and not just part of a very busy collage.', '2008-12-23 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147928, 748635, 96751, '<td valign="top">Angelic little face.  Stellar lighting.  Excellent color range.  Front page material here.</td>', 'Angelic little face.  Stellar lighting.  Excellent color range.  Front page material here.', '2008-12-23 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147929, 749144, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the title.  Much more than the photo :-(<br/> <br/>Great idea, but the choice of color oversaturation is really annoying my eyeballs.</td>', 'I love the title.  Much more than the photo :-( Great idea, but the choice of color oversaturation is really annoying my eyeballs.', '2008-12-23 15:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147930, 748937, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice and simple shot.  Love tones and focus.</td>', 'Very nice and simple shot.  Love tones and focus.', '2008-12-23 15:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147932, 749110, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Just, wow!  Gritty and very powerful.  Stunning use of colors and contrast.  Excellent work.  This is going on the front page.  Or else I just don''t get DCP voting at all :-)</td>', 'Wow!  Just, wow!  Gritty and very powerful.  Stunning use of colors and contrast.  Excellent work.  This is going on the front page.  Or else I just don''t get DCP voting at all :-)', '2008-12-23 15:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147933, 749061, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hey, it snowed in Malibu so you never know :-)</td>', 'Hey, it snowed in Malibu so you never know :-)', '2008-12-23 15:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147934, 749076, 96751, '<td valign="top">Holy Reindeer!  How long did it take to set THAT up?!  Great light display, but ironically, I feel this shot is lacking lighting!</td>', 'Holy Reindeer!  How long did it take to set THAT up?!  Great light display, but ironically, I feel this shot is lacking lighting!', '2008-12-23 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147938, 749121, 96751, '<td valign="top">Winner.  WinnerWinnerWinner.<br/> <br/>And for sure a holiday card for next year.  Advanced editing at its absolute best.  Subtle yet transforamtional.  The warmth and sharpness of the colors are the perfect foil for the soft and cold bw.  My only 10 so far.</td>', 'Winner.  WinnerWinnerWinner. And for sure a holiday card for next year.  Advanced editing at its absolute best.  Subtle yet transforamtional.  The warmth and sharpness of the colors are the perfect foil for the soft and cold bw.  My only 10 so far.', '2008-12-23 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147939, 747955, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I like the focus to be on her little outfit.  The face is so much cuter.</td>', 'I don''t know if I like the focus to be on her little outfit.  The face is so much cuter.', '2008-12-23 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147941, 749113, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, if only you could have underlit the milk!!!!  Great idea, colors, shapes.  But the contents of the bowl are really flat.</td>', 'Ah, if only you could have underlit the milk!!!!  Great idea, colors, shapes.  But the contents of the bowl are really flat.', '2008-12-23 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147952, 749151, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is so close to being great.  Why it''s not for me: the red lanyard/stem is a bit too long; the lighting on the ball too harsh and uneven.  The top part of the 8 ball completely disappears between the top of the inner white circle and the gold cap.  It would have been much more powerful to see even a vague outline of the entire sphere.</td>', 'Oh, this is so close to being great.  Why it''s not for me: the red lanyard/stem is a bit too long; the lighting on the ball too harsh and uneven.  The top part of the 8 ball completely disappears between the top of the inner white circle and the gold cap.  It would have been much more powerful to see even a vague outline of the entire sphere.', '2008-12-23 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5147953, 749084, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing, but exquisitely detailed shot.</td>', 'Very disturbing, but exquisitely detailed shot.', '2008-12-23 15:58:44.000000', NULL, 1);
