(5154640, 749056, 81362, '<td valign="top">Might have been good to make the top of the blue ribbon target in the background rounded white to echo the planned roundness of water drops. Despite all the threads grumbling about water drop shots, this will probably score well, but I don''t predict a blue ribbon. Not voting, just commenting.</td>', 'Might have been good to make the top of the blue ribbon target in the background rounded white to echo the planned roundness of water drops. Despite all the threads grumbling about water drop shots, this will probably score well, but I don''t predict a blue ribbon. Not voting, just commenting.', '2008-12-28 09:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154647, 748611, 81362, '<td valign="top">The yellow tones combine well with the deep greens of the background. Setting this up as a stack shows off the top item well, but hides the other cookies, with the darkest one looking unappetizingly like charcoal. Maybe an attractive positioning around the plate with a little overlapping would have been more appealing.</td>', 'The yellow tones combine well with the deep greens of the background. Setting this up as a stack shows off the top item well, but hides the other cookies, with the darkest one looking unappetizingly like charcoal. Maybe an attractive positioning around the plate with a little overlapping would have been more appealing.', '2008-12-28 10:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154651, 749131, 33672, '<td valign="top">if only......</td>', 'if only......', '2008-12-28 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154652, 749157, 33672, '<td valign="top">great eyes, Nice framing</td>', 'great eyes, Nice framing', '2008-12-28 10:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154655, 748045, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the finish product on the photo.</td>', 'I like the finish product on the photo.', '2008-12-28 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154659, 749139, 33672, '<td valign="top">very emotive. (One of the countries I''d like to see also.)</td>', 'very emotive. (One of the countries I''d like to see also.)', '2008-12-28 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154665, 749129, 33672, '<td valign="top">But what a great Movie</td>', 'But what a great Movie', '2008-12-28 10:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154667, 748972, 81362, '<td valign="top">Ummm ... I''m taken already. Good choice for a personalized card for your special someone. The head position is classic, and the background is handled especially well. Her eyes seem to be looking just a hair camera left of the lens center. Having the eyes shift slightly more to camera right might create an impression of stronger communication. To my taste, the amount of negative space caused by including so much of the hair on our left shifts the balance of the image unfavorably. You might consider experimenting with having the <strike>right</strike> left side a bit closer to the shoulder seam, maybe balanced by a little trimmed from the top. Others may disagree.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-31 10:24:18.</i></td>', 'Ummm ... I''m taken already. Good choice for a personalized card for your special someone. The head position is classic, and the background is handled especially well. Her eyes seem to be looking just a hair camera left of the lens center. Having the eyes shift slightly more to camera right might create an impression of stronger communication. To my taste, the amount of negative space caused by including so much of the hair on our left shifts the balance of the image unfavorably. You might consider experimenting with having the right left side a bit closer to the shoulder seam, maybe balanced by a little trimmed from the top. Others may disagree.', '2008-12-28 10:20:52.000000', '2008-12-31 10:24:18.000000', 1),
(5154668, 748628, 81362, '<td valign="top">Love the captured expression. (I look askance at those snow people myself, but they are pretty funny.) Excellent lighting, and using black background keeps us focused on the subject.</td>', 'Love the captured expression. (I look askance at those snow people myself, but they are pretty funny.) Excellent lighting, and using black background keeps us focused on the subject.', '2008-12-28 10:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154672, 748880, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice outfits and expressions. The darkness of the close together sides of their faces makes it just a little less festive and inviting than ideal. But it also looks like the pose woudl make it difficult to correct for those shadows.</td>', 'Nice outfits and expressions. The darkness of the close together sides of their faces makes it just a little less festive and inviting than ideal. But it also looks like the pose woudl make it difficult to correct for those shadows.', '2008-12-28 10:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
