(5155849, 748674, 30364, '<td valign="top">Crikey bear, you''ve lost some weight!  Or maybe you''re further away than I first thought.  Or maybe I just read it all wrong and you have a very tiny assistant now.<br/>From a LB point of view, it''s interesting how the focus is neither ''here'' nor ''there'', but right in between.  That seems just right for the shot.<br/>Doesn''t make it ''pop'' but makes it ''crackle'' instead, which also seems right of course.</td>', 'Crikey bear, you''ve lost some weight!  Or maybe you''re further away than I first thought.  Or maybe I just read it all wrong and you have a very tiny assistant now.From a LB point of view, it''s interesting how the focus is neither ''here'' nor ''there'', but right in between.  That seems just right for the shot.Doesn''t make it ''pop'' but makes it ''crackle'' instead, which also seems right of course.', '2008-12-29 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 0),
