(5156112, 749084, 32767, '<td valign="top">The degree to which I HATE these images knows no bounds. It''s not that I''m unaware of this issue but parading it around is really scary, in this type of forum. I mean we''re talking suicide, in a competition for virtual ribbons.<br/> <br/>The other issue is that this might a serious threat...I have no idea. If it is a cry for help...please get help.<br/> <br/>On a technical note (a la DPC)...I really like the sharpness where you plan to have your entry wound BUT by including the point of exit would have added some drama and anticipation. Nice B&amp;W conversion. 1<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-29 10:54:22.</i></td>', 'The degree to which I HATE these images knows no bounds. It''s not that I''m unaware of this issue but parading it around is really scary, in this type of forum. I mean we''re talking suicide, in a competition for virtual ribbons. The other issue is that this might a serious threat...I have no idea. If it is a cry for help...please get help. On a technical note (a la DPC)...I really like the sharpness where you plan to have your entry wound BUT by including the point of exit would have added some drama and anticipation. Nice B&W conversion. 1', '2008-12-29 08:37:51.000000', '2008-12-29 10:54:22.000000', 0),
