(5156613, 748437, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>This is, of course, not a "DPC-friendly" image, but it is wonderful nonetheless.  Kudos for entering it.  Ignore the scores when you submit images like this--but I surely appreciate your entering this kind of work.  I like seeing it!  I was one of the 7''s.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!This is, of course, not a "DPC-friendly" image, but it is wonderful nonetheless.  Kudos for entering it.  Ignore the scores when you submit images like this--but I surely appreciate your entering this kind of work.  I like seeing it!  I was one of the 7''s.', '2008-12-29 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5156618, 748685, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>This is a simple, serene image, perfectly toned, and invites the viewer in to explore it.  I want to go sit at that table and meet whoever else sits down there, too.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!This is a simple, serene image, perfectly toned, and invites the viewer in to explore it.  I want to go sit at that table and meet whoever else sits down there, too.', '2008-12-29 15:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5156627, 748674, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>FANTASTIC!!  Fantastic in both the "great" sense and the "fantasy" sense.  A dreamlike, cold winterscape, given depth/surreality by the focal range  and meaning/significance by the tiny figure in the distance.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!FANTASTIC!!  Fantastic in both the "great" sense and the "fantasy" sense.  A dreamlike, cold winterscape, given depth/surreality by the focal range  and meaning/significance by the tiny figure in the distance.', '2008-12-29 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
