(5156809, 749061, 52130, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JuliBoc:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful image, especially for Christmas. Did you use a star filter, or did the star effect happen naturally. The scene is truly amazing, to show all those elements at once: snow, sun, mountains, and ocean. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks, it happened naturally with f/14. Curves and burning also helped to accentuate it though.</td>', 'Originally posted by JuliBoc: Wonderful image, especially for Christmas. Did you use a star filter, or did the star effect happen naturally. The scene is truly amazing, to show all those elements at once: snow, sun, mountains, and ocean.   thanks, it happened naturally with f/14. Curves and burning also helped to accentuate it though.', '2008-12-29 17:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
