(5158357, 748066, 39560, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 3DsArcher:</b></div><hr/><i> Your kidding, right? We all wonder why someone gives us an anonomous less than favourable vote &amp; doesn''t tell us why. When someone comes along &amp; expresses what they truely think, it should be encouraged not knocked back. If we only ever get good comments, we will never grow. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on the blue ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No! I''m not kidding! There''s nothing complimenting the photo except saying it''s clean and crisp. The rest is just an expression of someones dislike of the content. I personally don''t consider that to be constructive critisism.</td>', 'Originally posted by 3DsArcher: Your kidding, right? We all wonder why someone gives us an anonomous less than favourable vote & doesn''t tell us why. When someone comes along & expresses what they truely think, it should be encouraged not knocked back. If we only ever get good comments, we will never grow.  Congratulations on the blue ribbon.   No! I''m not kidding! There''s nothing complimenting the photo except saying it''s clean and crisp. The rest is just an expression of someones dislike of the content. I personally don''t consider that to be constructive critisism.', '2008-12-30 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5158584, 748066, 88136, '<td valign="top">i am very happy that you scored so well with this. with photos like these either you do excellent or you fail miserably. she is a beautiful model, and you have a great setup. i would love to try something like this someday, i just have the small issue of all my freinds/potental models are under 18(me too) so i dont know if i could get away with it. anywas, great job, and dont listen to all the crap im guessing you''re getting from people about it.</td>', 'i am very happy that you scored so well with this. with photos like these either you do excellent or you fail miserably. she is a beautiful model, and you have a great setup. i would love to try something like this someday, i just have the small issue of all my freinds/potental models are under 18(me too) so i dont know if i could get away with it. anywas, great job, and dont listen to all the crap im guessing you''re getting from people about it.', '2008-12-30 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 0),
