(5159125, 748645, 80096, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories of touring a house that was being built for N.C. Wyeth, the famous painter and brother of Andrew. The view from the windows was spectacular, very much like the one in your photo and the house was in the early stages of being constructed. <br/>This is one of your best visionary images, it''s very well done and has a wonderful illustrative quality about it.</td>', 'This brings back memories of touring a house that was being built for N.C. Wyeth, the famous painter and brother of Andrew. The view from the windows was spectacular, very much like the one in your photo and the house was in the early stages of being constructed. This is one of your best visionary images, it''s very well done and has a wonderful illustrative quality about it.', '2008-12-31 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5159149, 749153, 68947, '<td valign="top">You know, Santa may run around the world in one night but, he works 365 days a year to be able to run around the world in one night!!!  Fuel prices have been a drag.  <br/> <br/>Really love this shot, Michelle.  It does remind me of a Norman Rockwell!!!  Oh, Woman...blow this up and frame it!  You really could be in advertising.  :)  <br/> <br/>This score was FAR too low for this shot......<br/> <br/>Shoulda asked Santa to strip and put a red bow on his whoha!!! ;)</td>', 'You know, Santa may run around the world in one night but, he works 365 days a year to be able to run around the world in one night!!!  Fuel prices have been a drag.   Really love this shot, Michelle.  It does remind me of a Norman Rockwell!!!  Oh, Woman...blow this up and frame it!  You really could be in advertising.  :)   This score was FAR too low for this shot...... Shoulda asked Santa to strip and put a red bow on his whoha!!! ;)', '2008-12-31 01:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
