(5160347, 748066, 52115, '<td valign="top">I''m sure many married (or not) couples have done this classic idea of putting ribbons and bows on Him or Her. When I saw it was going to get a ribbon. Personally, I also like some of the adult female Elves I sometimes see with Santas, wearing red and green tights.<br/> <br/>That''s agreat pose, the winding ribbon reminds me of a sweet, Candy Cane!<br/>Also balanced symetrically, elbow/heel on one side hair/knee on the other.</td>', 'I''m sure many married (or not) couples have done this classic idea of putting ribbons and bows on Him or Her. When I saw it was going to get a ribbon. Personally, I also like some of the adult female Elves I sometimes see with Santas, wearing red and green tights. That''s agreat pose, the winding ribbon reminds me of a sweet, Candy Cane!Also balanced symetrically, elbow/heel on one side hair/knee on the other.', '2008-12-31 15:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
