(5166338, 748932, 67152, '<td valign="top">Irene - This was easily one of the best shots in the challenge.  I am not sure what people were saying about ''too grainy''.  I think someone confused texture with noise or something....</td>', 'Irene - This was easily one of the best shots in the challenge.  I am not sure what people were saying about ''too grainy''.  I think someone confused texture with noise or something....', '2009-01-02 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5167872, 748954, 54645, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>First, congratulation on a wonderful photograph and high finish. I love the concept and execution of this image to convey "happy time" for yourself. Good composition with the focal point in the bottom third intersection, strong use of negative space helps to convey your desire for personal time by my interpretation. Colors are vibrant, and not oversaturated. <br/> <br/>I do believe you pushed the limit with the sharpening, and in is overdone in my opinion along the rim of the face of the clock and petals. <br/> <br/>I like the DOF you chose, but I wonder how this would have looked at f/11, thus bringing the foreground in to greater focus.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 6 during voting due to the sharpening. Cleaner processing would have recieved a higher vote from me. <br/> <br/>Nice work. Cheers, Ben</td>', 'Critique Club First, congratulation on a wonderful photograph and high finish. I love the concept and execution of this image to convey "happy time" for yourself. Good composition with the focal point in the bottom third intersection, strong use of negative space helps to convey your desire for personal time by my interpretation. Colors are vibrant, and not oversaturated.  I do believe you pushed the limit with the sharpening, and in is overdone in my opinion along the rim of the face of the clock and petals.  I like the DOF you chose, but I wonder how this would have looked at f/11, thus bringing the foreground in to greater focus. I gave this a 6 during voting due to the sharpening. Cleaner processing would have recieved a higher vote from me.  Nice work. Cheers, Ben', '2009-01-03 14:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
